        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Grandeur CIRCIRCOM, Circulaire Knob Single Cylinder Entryset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Circulaire Knob and Deadbolt Entryset is perfect for the transitional home. It has a classic style that is at the same time fashionable. The Circulaire Knob Single Cylinder Entryset will fit doors 1-3/4 inches thick with a 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backset. Choose from several beautiful finishes. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Single Cylinder Entry Set:</b> The deadbolt is thrown and retracted by key from the exterior and by turn unit on the interior. A knob operates the door latch from both interior and the exterior.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Grandeur CIRCIRCOM Circulaire Rosette with Circulaire Knob and Deadbolt Combo Pack:\r\n</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Made out of solid forged brass.</li>\r\n<li>One inch throw deadbolt.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</li>\r\n<li>10 Year Finish Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Single Cylinder Circulaire Entryset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Circulaire Knob Diameter: 2.375\"</li>\r\n<li>Circulaire Knob Projection: 2.5\"</li>\r\n<li>Circulaire Rosette Diameter: 2.7\"</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt Diameter: 2.7\"</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt Rosette Projection: 0.45\"</li>\r\n<li>Thumb Turn Projection: 1.125\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/GRA-CIRCIRCOM-Specifications.pdf?v=1704262385\" target=\"new\"><b>Grandeur CIRCIRCOM Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
